OL,3,A'I run a spotless kitchen', says
OL,4,AMichelin-star restaurant chef in wake
OL,5,Aof food hygiene debacle
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe chef at Wales' only
OL,8,Ftwo-Michelin-star restaurant has
OL,9,Fdefended the way he operates his
OL,10,Fkitchen after the venue came under
OL,11,Fscrutiny over food hygiene standards.
OL,13,FWhile chasing a third Michelin star,
OL,14,FYnyshir was handed a one-star hygiene
OL,15,Frating in February and told to improve
OL,16,Fdue to concerns about raw and
OL,17,Fundercooked foods.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
