OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'I run a spotless kitchen', says
OL,4,AMichelin-star restaurant chef in wake
OL,5,Aof food hygiene debacle
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe news made global headlines and was
OL,8,Fa blow to Ward and his team, but in
OL,9,FApple TV's documentary series Knife
OL,10,FEdge: Chasing Michelin Stars, Ward said
OL,11,FYnyshir was "an incredible place".
OL,13,F"There's nothing in there that's
OL,14,Famateurish," he told the programme. "I
OL,15,Frun a spotless kitchen."
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
