OL,3,ACrypto giant Binance hit by $6.3bn hack
OL,4,Asuspected to be largest in history
OL,5,
OL,6,FCryptocurrency giant Binance said on
OL,7,FThursday that $6.3bn (#4.7bn) of
OL,8,Fdigital assets have been impacted by
OL,9,Fwhat could be the largest hack in
OL,10,Fhistory.
OL,12,FThe world's biggest crypto exchange
OL,13,Fsaid about half of those assets had
OL,14,Fbeen frozen but that many remained in
OL,15,Fthe hands of the hackers, adding that
OL,16,Fit will "cover all losses".
OL,18,FEarly checks show the incident may have
OL,19,Finvolved an engineer's laptop that had
OL,20,Fbeen compromised, which allowed an
OL,21,Fattacker to make unauthorised
OL,22,Fwithdrawals, Binance said.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
